## 15. PRACTICAL NUANCES (check before starting)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

15.1 I know this is for DeepSeek-V4-flash and other cards — but the entire principle of "measure before / measure after, gate, persist, PL_failsafe" is universal.

15.2 Advice: DO NOT use STRONG back-end terminations.

15.3 If "GPU requires reset" (Xid 45/119) occurs during gate — step the point down and continue.

